{
  "artifact_profile": "l2_standard",
  "description": "Runs a fixture-backed Web-platform semantics probe for IntersectionObserver callback. The driver reads output from the self-hosted fixture `/fixtures/l2_round3/g_io.html`, and the server-side grader compares it with the checked-in expected answer. Current probe details: #out starts 'PENDING'; IntersectionObserver flips to IO_FIRED (or IO_NEVER after 1.5s).",
